@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### List orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### Create an order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 42.50 }

### Get an order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update an order
PUT {{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 99.99 }

### Delete an order
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Rollback: a negative amount throws inside the handler
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": -1 }
